@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### List all design styles
GET {{baseUrl}}/styles

### Search styles by query
GET {{baseUrl}}/styles/search?q=modern

### Get a style by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/styles/minimalist

### Get moodboard images for a style
GET {{baseUrl}}/styles/minimalist/images?limit=5&offset=0

### Seed style catalog (dev only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/styles/seed

### Seed style moodboard images (dev only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/styles/seed-images
